WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.600
The first time LYNX SHARE opens, it asks where you are coming from.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:14.200
Each answer picks a layout. BandLab and FL Studio Mobile users get the Simple layout.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:19.200
FL Studio users get the Pattern layout, Ableton Live users the Clip-launch layout.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:25.200
Here we pick BandLab. The Simple layout opens with a starter beat.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:29.600
You can switch at any time: View, Layout style.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:35.400
The same song in the Pattern layout: the Channel rack, the Playlist and the Mixer.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:39.600
Now the Clip-launch layout.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:45.400
The tracks become columns of clips that you launch, as in Ableton Live.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:51.400
All three layouts play and save the same project. Pick the one that feels right.
